<Base title="GATE 2027 study plan" description="A practical GATE 2027 study plan template: phases, weekly rhythm, revision and mocks. Generate your own with the planner tool." canonicalPath="/guides/study-plan/">
  <section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><p class="kicker">Template · adapt it</p><h1>Study plan</h1><p class="lead">Three phases: build (fundamentals), strengthen (practice + revision), sharpen (mocks + gaps). Generate your dated plan in the tool below.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn primary" href="/tools/study-planner/">Generate my plan</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap grid cols-3">
    <div class="card"><h3>Phase 1 — Build</h3><p>Cover every subject once at basic → GATE level. Daily: learn + 5–10 questions + 15-min revision.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Phase 2 — Strengthen</h3><p>Topic-wise PYQs, mistake log, weekly revision sweep. Add one timed section-test per week.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Phase 3 — Sharpen</h3><p>Full mocks, error-pattern review, formula sheets, light new content. Sleep and admit-card logistics.</p></div>
  </div></section>
</Base>
